                            <span class="ls-drawer-label">打开串口后自动保存日志</span>
                            <span class="ls-setting-desc">独立于全局应用运行日志，仅记录串口 RX/TX 数据。</span>
                        </div>
                        <label class="ls-switch">
                            <input type="checkbox"
                                   checked="@Settings.Serial.AutoSaveSerialLogOnOpen"
                                   @onchange="OnAutoSaveSerialLogChangedAsync" />
